# Keep the build context lean and hermetic. None of these are consumed by
# deploy/docker/Dockerfile — dependencies are installed inside the image from
# the lockfiles. A host-local web/node_modules carries native bindings for the
# BUILDER's platform (e.g. darwin-arm64); copied into the linux/amd64 web-builder
# it shadows the freshly installed linux bindings and the rolldown/vite build
# fails with "Cannot find native binding". Some BuildKit versions don't expand a
# leading "**/", so the node_modules paths are listed explicitly too.
node_modules
**/node_modules
web/node_modules
web/electron/node_modules
.git
.venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
